vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek引入联想系资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行形式化验证</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic将Agent Skills开放标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布智能体计算引擎ACE，为AI智能体提供专属微型虚拟机环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef68ff4c5f582ea687e38f4a06f7efe3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于10月22日正式推出智能体计算引擎（Agent Compute Engine，简称ACE），旨在为AI智能体提供安全、持久且可弹性伸缩的专属计算环境。ACE通过为每个智能体分配硬件隔离的微型虚拟机（microVM），支持智能体安全地执行代码、调用工具及操作浏览器。该环境具备独立的客户内核与根权限，并利用Cloud Hypervisor边界实现硬件隔离，有效降低数据外泄风险。ACE的核心优势在于“持久且可暂停”的特性，在20万个智能体的压测中，环境的暂停与恢复时间不到500毫秒，大幅提升了单台服务器的智能体承载密度。该引擎此前已应用于Gemini、Gemini平台及Antigravity等内部流程。目前，开发者可通过Google Cloud直接调用ACE，自主管理智能体环境的镜像、身份及网络访问，底层资源调</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX 与特斯拉成立特别委员会讨论合并，拟整合汽车、火箭与 AI 业务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX 与特斯拉已各自成立特别委员会，正式启动合并事宜的讨论。此次合并旨在整合特斯拉的自动驾驶、人形机器人技术与 SpaceX 的大模型及算力基础设施，构建一个具备自主决策能力的 AI 综合体。财务数据显示，SpaceX 第三季度“超级智能”部门营收达 75.6 亿美元，其中算力租赁业务贡献显著。双方此前已在 Terafab 晶圆厂及 Macrohard AI 项目上展开早期合作。分析指出，合并的核心驱动力在于消除内部利益冲突、争夺稀缺的 NVIDIA GPU 资源，并帮助马斯克通过换股方式巩固对特斯拉的绝对控制权。若交易达成，马斯克预计将大幅提升净资产，并可能提前解锁天价薪酬方案。目前，市场传闻该交易计划于 2027 年上半年完成。尽管马斯克强调 AI 协同效应，但合并后巨大的资本支出压力及反垄断合规性</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek引入联想系资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b95176ef495da074de7b835cd89d91.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">大模型独角兽DeepSeek近期完成新一轮融资，成功引入君联资本、石溪资本及吉利等多家产业与财务投资者，联想系资本正式进入其股东阵营。为推进资本化进程，DeepSeek已于今年9月聘任新任CFO，并选定中信证券作为IPO顾问，最快有望于2027年初启动上市。在资本绑定前，联想已将DeepSeek模型全面接入其AI PC、服务器及企业AI解决方案中。此次融资标志着双方合作从技术适配升级至资本与产业生态的深度协同。对于行业而言，此举不仅强化了联想在AI终端与基础设施业务的竞争力，也反映出头部大模型厂商正加速向资本化与产业生态深度融合的新阶段演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行形式化验证</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/913c5611c44d3700de2470664f5bd30d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic与Theorem Labs合作，利用Claude模型对RISC-V汇编指令及生产级开源代码库进行形式化验证。在数周内，Claude完成了123个开源库、239个测试入口的分析，产出1.8亿行Rocq数学证明代码。该方法将测试入口转译为数学命题，实现了全路径覆盖，成功识别出模糊测试（fuzzing）无法发现的隐秘逻辑漏洞、潜伏十余年的高危缺陷及x86处理器硬件错误，并具备自动修复与验证能力。目前，首批证明已公开。该技术将代码正确性转化为数学定理，大幅降低了底层机器码验证的工程门槛。按当前效率推算，预计投入1.34亿美元，至2027年底有望完成Nix生态95%的机器码验证，为软件安全提供了一种全新的自动化防御路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic将Agent Skills开放标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于10月22日宣布，正式将Agent Skills开放标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下的Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF），包括该标准的名称、标志、GitHub组织及agentskills.io域名。Agent Skills作为智能体的“说明书”，通过SKILL.md文件定义特定任务与领域知识，支持智能体在不同产品间复用工作流程。自2025年12月发布以来，该标准已获ChatGPT、Cursor、GitHub Copilot及VS Code等70多个平台集成，公开技能数量近100万个，累计安装量约2.8亿次。此次捐赠旨在推动该标准脱离单一公司掌控，实现由社区共同治理的供应商中立化。Anthropic此前已将Model Context Protocol（MCP）捐赠给AAIF，</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
